{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t屯門公路往九龍方向近虎地，下午有貨車起火，無人受傷。<br/>\n<br/>\n事發在下午3時許，警方報接有貨車起火，司機走出車外，消防到場處理。<br/>\n<br/>\n多條網上片段所見，整輛貨車火光熊熊。火警在近4時被救熄。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T09:19:15.038177+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":96,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T08:41:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T09:32:39.077448+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T09:12:24.073338+00:00","content_hash":"f3224d1cb2a4cd90afb7b6b11359fc91244873b847018aa2cc5e3980cd735ee2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}